id: vehicle-big-blaster
name: Big Blaster
kind: vehicle quality
slots: 1~2
source: Vehicles
needsQuality: vehicle-weapon-installed
# "A Vehicle Weapon of your choice when selecting this Vehicle Quality" - picked on its row.
choose: weapon
chooseCount: 1
# Its entry as the Vehicles page prints it, word for word.
text: >
  Big Blaster: This Vehicle's Weapon possesses potent destructive force.
  –Prerequisites: Weapon Installed Vehicle Quality, did not select a Profile with an AoE for its effects
  –Quality Slots: 1~2
  –Effects: Apply a Minor Sphere AoE to any Attacking Maneuver made with a Vehicle Weapon of your choice when
  selecting this Vehicle Quality. The Target Square for this AoE may be any Square, EXCEPT a Square that this Vehicle
  would occupy.

  If this Vehicle Quality takes up 2 Quality Slots, apply the Intense Blast Advantage to any Attacking Maneuver made
  with that Vehicle Weapon.

---
